Copyrights in the Patina project are retained by their contributors. No
copyright assignment is required to contribute to the Patina project.

The Patina project is derived from the Rust project's source code:

* A subset of files from the Rust project repository
  <https://github.com/rust-lang/rust>, as found at commit
  `cb40c25f6aebb637163d26bf76a680ed6e5d1eda`, is committed as a snapshot to this
