* The contents of the `rust/` subdirectory have since been modified by the
  Patina project: files have been changed, added, and removed. The Patina
  project may also incorporate later changes from the Rust project's repository.
  Each change is recorded in the version control history.
* The Rust project's version control history, at least up to and including the
